<!DOCTYPE html><html data-dpl-id="dpl_3UkQ5hhrByEFJf3cbHkTyZ8iLC24" lang="en"><head><meta charSet="utf-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"/><link rel="stylesheet" href="/_next/static/immutable/chunks/0wavsofptmb3_.css" data-precedence="next"/><link rel="preload" as="script" fetchPriority="low" href="/_next/static/immutable/chunks/1ddg70z30qn04.js"/><script src="/_next/static/immutable/chunks/41b5e_o-w2xun.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/immutable/chunks/1cmnso0jnkwt6.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/immutable/chunks/2-k_577svdq9-.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/immutable/chunks/turbopack-2l6qdc9b47pt9.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/immutable/chunks/29nm6-6cbu5hi.js" async="" crossorigin=""></script><script src="/_next/static/immutable/chunks/1oy56_o8_-y-n.js" async="" crossorigin=""></script><script src="/_next/static/immutable/chunks/2zwhhy9o5ixk8.js" async="" crossorigin=""></script><script src="/_next/static/immutable/chunks/19t2u5p3wpilq.js" async="" crossorigin=""></script><title>MCPCN — MCP Component Network</title><meta name="description" content="React components and workflow blocks for human-controlled MCP Apps."/><link rel="icon" href="/icon.svg?icon.0-2l4nus4v8l3.svg" sizes="any" type="image/svg+xml"/><script src="/_next/static/immutable/chunks/0c0hxoamwjsbw.js" noModule=""></script></head><body><div hidden=""><!--$--><!--/$--></div><header class="site-nav"><a class="brand" href="/"><span class="brand-mark">M</span>MCPCN</a><nav><a href="/docs">Docs</a><a href="/components">Components</a><a href="/blocks">Blocks</a><a href="/examples">Examples</a><a href="/playground">Playground</a></nav><div class="nav-actions"><a class="button secondary" href="/create">Create</a><a href="https://github.com/alvarovillalbaa/mcpcn-ui" class="button">GitHub</a></div></header><main><span class="eyebrow">host-state</span><h1>NoDataState</h1><p class="lede">Distinguish reported empty records, unmatched queries and data not yet provided without fetching data.</p><div class="filter-row"><span class="pill">Domain component</span><span class="pill">React</span><span class="pill">Validated data</span></div><section class="preview-shell" aria-label="NoDataState preview"><div class="mcpcn-stack"><label class="mcpcn-label">Preview theme<select aria-label="Preview theme"><option value="light" selected="">Light</option><option value="dark">Dark</option></select></label><div data-preview-theme="light"><section aria-label="NoDataState demonstration" class="mcpcn-stack"><p>Explore the reported state and request review. Requests only update this demonstration.</p><label>Request response <select aria-label="Host-state request response"><option value="immediate" selected="">Immediate</option><option value="hold">Hold until settled</option><option value="throw">Throw current request</option></select></label><div class="mcpcn-row"><label><input type="checkbox" checked=""/>Callback enabled</label><label><input type="checkbox"/>External busy</label><label><input type="checkbox" checked=""/>Mount component</label><label><input type="checkbox"/>Malformed data</label><label><input type="checkbox" checked=""/>Action available</label></div><div class="mcpcn-row"><button type="button">Replace report revision</button><button type="button">Replace callback</button><button type="button">Remove supplied action</button><button type="button" disabled="">Resolve oldest request</button><button type="button" disabled="">Reject oldest request</button></div><section class="mcpcn mcpcn-card" role="region" aria-label="Reported empty collection" aria-busy="false" style="overflow-wrap:anywhere"><div class="mcpcn-header"><div class="mcpcn-row mcpcn-between"><h3 class="mcpcn-title">Reported empty collection</h3><span class="mcpcn mcpcn-badge">empty</span></div></div><div class="mcpcn-body mcpcn-stack"><p role="status">Authored consumer report; no live state was checked.</p><p>Collection: <strong>Authored records</strong></p><p>Reported reason: <!-- -->No matches</p><p>Reported query: <!-- -->Authored query &lt;not executable&gt;</p><p class="mcpcn-hint">No data fetch or empty-result inference is performed by this component.</p><p>Reported at: <time dateTime="2026-11-10T00:00:00Z">2026-11-10T00:00:00Z</time></p></div><div class="mcpcn-footer"><button class="mcpcn mcpcn-button" type="button">Request consumer review</button></div></section><div class="mcpcn-row"><output aria-label="Host-state intent count">0</output><output aria-label="Settled host-state requests">0</output><output aria-label="Pending host-state requests">0</output></div><pre class="mcpcn-code" aria-label="Last host-state intent">No request sent.</pre></section></div></div></section><section class="section prose"><h2>Install</h2><pre class="code">pnpm dlx mcpcn add <!-- -->no-data-state</pre><p>Public npm availability is a separate release gate. The repository documentation records the currently verified source, archives and hosting profile.</p><h2>Data props</h2><p>These fields come from the actual exported schema. Defaults may be omitted on input; the schema below describes validated output. Runtime checks also validate identities, conditional values and safe evidence links.</p><div class="mcpcn-table-wrap"><table class="mcpcn-table"><caption>NoDataState<!-- --> data fields</caption><thead><tr><th>Field</th><th>Type</th><th>Input</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row"><code>id</code></th><td>string</td><td>Required</td></tr><tr><th scope="row"><code>revision</code></th><td>string</td><td>Required</td></tr><tr><th scope="row"><code>title</code></th><td>string</td><td>Required</td></tr><tr><th scope="row"><code>message</code></th><td>string</td><td>Required</td></tr><tr><th scope="row"><code>description</code></th><td>string</td><td>Optional</td></tr><tr><th scope="row"><code>reportedAt</code></th><td>string</td><td>Optional</td></tr><tr><th scope="row"><code>action</code></th><td>object</td><td>Optional</td></tr><tr><th scope="row"><code>state</code></th><td>string</td><td>Required</td></tr><tr><th scope="row"><code>collectionLabel</code></th><td>string</td><td>Required</td></tr><tr><th scope="row"><code>reason</code></th><td>enum</td><td>Required</td></tr><tr><th scope="row"><code>querySummary</code></th><td>string</td><td>Optional</td></tr></tbody></table></div><h2>React integration</h2><pre class="code">import { NoDataState } from &quot;@mcpcn/react&quot;;
import type { NoDataStateData } from &quot;@mcpcn/schemas&quot;;

const data: NoDataStateData = {
  &quot;revision&quot;: &quot;1&quot;,
  &quot;message&quot;: &quot;Authored consumer report; no live state was checked.&quot;,
  &quot;reportedAt&quot;: &quot;2026-11-10T00:00:00Z&quot;,
  &quot;action&quot;: {
    &quot;id&quot;: &quot;review&quot;,
    &quot;revision&quot;: &quot;1&quot;,
    &quot;label&quot;: &quot;Request consumer review&quot;,
    &quot;available&quot;: true
  },
  &quot;id&quot;: &quot;data-1&quot;,
  &quot;state&quot;: &quot;empty&quot;,
  &quot;title&quot;: &quot;Reported empty collection&quot;,
  &quot;collectionLabel&quot;: &quot;Authored records&quot;,
  &quot;reason&quot;: &quot;no-matches&quot;,
  &quot;querySummary&quot;: &quot;Authored query &lt;not executable&gt;&quot;
};

&lt;NoDataState {...data} onAction={action =&gt; console.log(action)} /&gt;</pre><p><code>className</code> styles the surface and <code>onAction</code> receives consumer-owned intent. The new domain controls and revised approval/form surfaces expose <code>busy</code> and <code>error</code> feedback. Controlled selections and answers must be acknowledged by updating their props.</p><h2>Events</h2><div class="mcpcn-table-wrap"><table class="mcpcn-table"><caption>NoDataState<!-- --> action payloads</caption><thead><tr><th>Action type</th><th>Data</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row"><code>request-data-refresh</code></th><td><code>{ componentId, componentRevision, actionId, actionRevision }</code></td></tr></tbody></table></div><h2>JSON Schema</h2><pre class="code" aria-label="NoDataState JSON Schema">{
  &quot;$schema&quot;: &quot;https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema&quot;,
  &quot;type&quot;: &quot;object&quot;,
  &quot;properties&quot;: {
    &quot;id&quot;: {
      &quot;type&quot;: &quot;string&quot;,
      &quot;pattern&quot;: &quot;^[A-Za-z0-9][A-Za-z0-9._:-]{0,127}$&quot;
    },
    &quot;revision&quot;: {
      &quot;type&quot;: &quot;string&quot;,
      &quot;pattern&quot;: &quot;^[A-Za-z0-9][A-Za-z0-9._:-]{0,127}$&quot;
    },
    &quot;title&quot;: {
      &quot;type&quot;: &quot;string&quot;,
      &quot;maxLength&quot;: 300
    },
    &quot;message&quot;: {
      &quot;type&quot;: &quot;string&quot;,
      &quot;maxLength&quot;: 4000
    },
    &quot;description&quot;: {
      &quot;type&quot;: &quot;string&quot;,
      &quot;maxLength&quot;: 4000
    },
    &quot;reportedAt&quot;: {
      &quot;type&quot;: &quot;string&quot;,
      &quot;format&quot;: &quot;date-time&quot;,
      &quot;pattern&quot;: &quot;^(?:(?:\\d\\d[2468][048]|\\d\\d[13579][26]|\\d\\d0[48]|[02468][048]00|[13579][26]00)-02-29|\\d{4}-(?:(?:0[13578]|1[02])-(?:0[1-9]|[12]\\d|3[01])|(?:0[469]|11)-(?:0[1-9]|[12]\\d|30)|(?:02)-(?:0[1-9]|1\\d|2[0-8])))T(?:(?:[01]\\d|2[0-3]):[0-5]\\d(?::[0-5]\\d(?:\\.\\d+)?)?(?:Z|([+-](?:[01]\\d|2[0-3]):[0-5]\\d)))$&quot;
    },
    &quot;action&quot;: {
      &quot;type&quot;: &quot;object&quot;,
      &quot;properties&quot;: {
        &quot;id&quot;: {
          &quot;type&quot;: &quot;string&quot;,
          &quot;pattern&quot;: &quot;^[A-Za-z0-9][A-Za-z0-9._:-]{0,127}$&quot;
        },
        &quot;revision&quot;: {
          &quot;type&quot;: &quot;string&quot;,
          &quot;pattern&quot;: &quot;^[A-Za-z0-9][A-Za-z0-9._:-]{0,127}$&quot;
        },
        &quot;label&quot;: {
          &quot;type&quot;: &quot;string&quot;,
          &quot;maxLength&quot;: 300
        },
        &quot;available&quot;: {
          &quot;type&quot;: &quot;boolean&quot;
        }
      },
      &quot;required&quot;: [
        &quot;id&quot;,
        &quot;revision&quot;,
        &quot;label&quot;,
        &quot;available&quot;
      ],
      &quot;additionalProperties&quot;: false
    },
    &quot;state&quot;: {
      &quot;type&quot;: &quot;string&quot;,
      &quot;const&quot;: &quot;empty&quot;
    },
    &quot;collectionLabel&quot;: {
      &quot;type&quot;: &quot;string&quot;,
      &quot;maxLength&quot;: 300
    },
    &quot;reason&quot;: {
      &quot;type&quot;: &quot;string&quot;,
      &quot;enum&quot;: [
        &quot;no-records&quot;,
        &quot;no-matches&quot;,
        &quot;not-yet-provided&quot;
      ]
    },
    &quot;querySummary&quot;: {
      &quot;type&quot;: &quot;string&quot;,
      &quot;maxLength&quot;: 4000
    }
  },
  &quot;required&quot;: [
    &quot;id&quot;,
    &quot;revision&quot;,
    &quot;title&quot;,
    &quot;message&quot;,
    &quot;state&quot;,
    &quot;collectionLabel&quot;,
    &quot;reason&quot;
  ],
  &quot;additionalProperties&quot;: false
}</pre><h2>Structured tool result</h2><pre class="code">import { NoDataStateSchema } from &quot;@mcpcn/schemas&quot;;
import { createStructuredResult } from &quot;@mcpcn/server&quot;;

export function reviewedResult(candidate: unknown) {
  const data = NoDataStateSchema.parse(candidate);
  return createStructuredResult(&quot;no-data-state&quot;, data);
}</pre><h2>Security contract</h2><p>Previews use authored data and consumer callbacks. Applications own authorization, persistence, tool execution and explicit model-context publication.</p><p><strong>Declared model-visible fields:</strong> <!-- -->id, revision, action.id, action.revision</p><p><strong>Private fields:</strong> <!-- -->title, message, description, reportedAt, state, action.label, action.available, featureLabel, currentPlan, requiredPlan, hostLabel, requirements, collectionLabel, reason, querySummary, bridgeLabel, phase, elapsedMs, progress, serviceLabel, unsentChanges, resourceLabel, requesterLabel, scopes, expiredAt, requestFeedback</p><p><strong>Declared consumer tool intents:</strong> <!-- -->None</p><p><strong>Destructive intent:</strong> <!-- -->No by default</p><h2>Host and keyboard behavior</h2><p>Host integration uses the consuming application&#x27;s runtime provider. Native inputs, buttons, links and semantic tables expose the local interactions shown above. External-host compatibility and full accessibility conformance require their own acceptance evidence.</p></section></main><!--$--><!--/$--><footer><div><strong>MCPCN</strong><p>Human control for agentic apps.</p></div><div><a href="/llms.txt">llms.txt</a><a href="https://github.com/alvarovillalbaa/mcpcn-ui">GitHub</a><a href="https://github.com/alvarovillalbaa/mcpcn-ui/blob/main/SECURITY.md">Security</a></div></footer><script src="/_next/static/immutable/chunks/1ddg70z30qn04.js" id="_R_" async=""></script><script>(self.__next_f=self.__next_f||[]).push([0])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"1:\"$Sreact.fragment\"\n2:I[14058,[\"/_next/static/immutable/chunks/29nm6-6cbu5hi.js\"],\"\"]\n3:I[43820,[\"/_next/static/immutable/chunks/29nm6-6cbu5hi.js\"],\"default\"]\n4:I[98737,[\"/_next/static/immutable/chunks/29nm6-6cbu5hi.js\"],\"default\"]\n6:I[69110,[\"/_next/static/immutable/chunks/29nm6-6cbu5hi.js\"],\"OutletBoundary\"]\n7:\"$Sreact.suspense\"\na:I[69110,[\"/_next/static/immutable/chu